    <string name="settings_instrument_live">立即生效。</string>
    <string name="settings_instrument_lane">隐藏原车车道提示</string>
    <string name="settings_instrument_lane_desc">可选。停止后恢复当前缓存状态；无缓存时等待原车后续更新。</string>
    <string name="settings_instrument_online">在线查询歌词</string>
    <string name="settings_instrument_online_desc">优先查询网易云音乐，未匹配时尝试 LRCLIB。发送歌名、歌手、专辑和时长。车机需要联网，缓存歌词可离线使用。</string>
